---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-ink/8 bg-violet-deep text-cream">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 md:px-8">
		<div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<div>
				<p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Violeta</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gold-light/90">
					Semi Joias
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/75">
					Peças selecionadas com acabamento premium. Banhos duráveis e design
					atemporal para realçar sua beleza no dia a dia. Peças com 1 ano de
					garantia.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">
					Links
				</h3>
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-cream/80">
					<li>
						<a href="/catalogo" class="transition hover:text-gold-light">Catálogo</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/catalogo#cuidados" class="transition hover:text-gold-light"
							>Cuidados com suas joias</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://www.instagram.com/violetasemij0ias/"
							class="transition hover:text-gold-light"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							>Instagram @violetasemij0ias</a
						>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">
					Contato
				</h3>
				<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/75">
					Dúvidas sobre tamanhos, banhos ou envio? Fale com a gente no WhatsApp
					ou por e-mail.
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://wa.me/5519995573316"
							class="font-medium text-cream transition hover:text-gold-light"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							>WhatsApp</a
						>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="mailto:violetasemij0ias@gmail.com"
							class="text-cream/80 transition hover:text-gold-light"
							>violetasemij0ias@gmail.com</a
						>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="mt-12 border-t border-cream/10 pt-8 text-center text-xs text-cream/45">
			© {year} Violeta Semi Joias.
			<span class="mt-2 block">
				Desenvolvido por{" "}
				<a
					href="https://arkersoft.com.br"
					class="text-cream/55 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-gold-light hover:underline"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>arkersoft.com.br</a
				>
			</span>
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>
